{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42046","headline":"哭故主人陈太师 · 李中","name":"哭故主人陈太师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年孤迹寄侯门，入室升堂忝厚恩。\n游遍春郊随茜斾，饮残秋月待金尊。\n车鱼郑重知难报，吐握周旋不可论。\n长恸裴回逝川上，白杨萧飒又黄昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}